    pushes coalesced updates.
  - Composition (web GlassPanel + <h3> Cog title + Grid[4 status cards] + grid[9 InlineMetrics]):
      • GlassPanel  -> TSGlassPanel.
      • <h3> title  -> always-visible uppercase header w/ leading gearshape glyph,
                       web t('drivetrain.liveMotor','Live Motor Status').
      • Status cards (web `Grid cols 2/sm:4`, label + bold colour-coded value):
          - Shift State  -> shift_state ?? '—'                                  (cyan).
          - Power        -> power_kw != null ? `${fmtNumber(power_kw)} kW` : '—' (purple).
          - Regen        -> regen_kw != null ? `${fmtNumber(regen_kw)} kW` : '—' (green).
          - Source       -> source ?? '—'                                       (text-primary).
      • Inline metrics (web `grid cols 2/sm:3/lg:4` of <InlineMetric icon value label>):
          - Front/Rear RPM   -> motor_rpm_{front,rear} != null ? `${fmtInt} RPM` : '—'  (Activity cyan/purple).
          - Front/Rear Torque-> torque_nm_{front,rear} != null ? `${fmtNumber} Nm` : '—' (Zap cyan/purple).
          - Front/Rear MotorTemp -> motor_temp_c_{front,rear} != null ?
                                     `${fmtNumber(toTemp(c))} ${tempUnit}` : '—'         (Thermometer red).
          - Inverter Temp    -> inverter_temp_c != null ? … : '—'  (Thermometer amber).
          - Battery Temp     -> battery_temp_c != null ? … : '—'   (Thermometer green).
          - HV Isolation     -> isolationResistance != null && >0 ? `${fmtNumber} kΩ` : '—'  (Shield;
                                threshold ladder null/≤0→muted, ≥500→green, ≥100→amber, else red).
        web hex → token sRGB: cyan→accent, purple→chartSeriesPower, green→statusSuccess,
        red→chartSeriesTemperature, amber→statusWarning, text-primary→textPrimary, muted→textMuted.
  - States (ALL rendered, each with a #if DEBUG preview + a model/view test):
